  "id_alignment": "Bind the fresh USGS daily-values response and its derived interval record by source digest. Match agency and site ID, parameter 00060 and statistic 00003, then pair whole local calendar days using each site's time zone and actual elapsed boundaries. Set the first designated station as left and the second as right. Verify station order, dates, unique rows, units, qualifiers and the approved-day validity mask before interpreting the sign. Have the reviewers share any correction to the common dates, units, sign or bounds during the parallel review.",
